// Copy this file to `Secrets.xcconfig` and fill in the values.
// `Secrets.xcconfig` is gitignored — do not commit it.
//
// This pair is the anonymous "web client" credential that velov.grandlyon.com ships in
// plain text to every visitor. It grants exactly the logged-out-visitor capability the
// public website already exposes to anyone, and nothing more. See VLSKit's
// API_REFERENCE.md, section "Per-bike detail", for the terms-of-service framing before
// you use it.
//
// Note: xcconfig treats `//` as the start of a comment. Neither half of this pair
// contains `//`, but keep that in mind if a future value does.

VLS_WEB_CLIENT_CODE = vls.web.lyon:PRD
VLS_WEB_CLIENT_KEY = your-key-here
